==Trivia==
*The illustration rare print of this card features the exterior of [[Snowpoint Temple]], where {{p|Regigigas}} can be found in {{game|Diamond and Pearl|s|Pokémon Diamond, Pearl}}, {{game|Platinum||Platinum}}, {{game|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl|s|Brilliant Diamond, and Shining Pearl}}. It can be only be fought as long as {{P|Regirock}}, {{p|Regice}}, and {{p|Registeel}}—also featured in the illustration—are in the player's [[party]]. All four Pokémon are included in the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion with artwork by [[Tomokazu Komiya]] and, together, form the "Giants Unleashed" [[Space-Time Smackdown (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]].

===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Regigigas|243}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos}}.
*'''Raging Hammer''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Next Destinies|Regigigas-EX|82}} from the {{TCG|Next Destinies}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|X}}.

